                            R E L E A S E   I N F O

        Program ......... KeyMine v1.0
        Target .......... Mine-imator (8-character key format)
        Type ............ Key generator / key validator
        Group ........... DOHM
        Release Date .... 09.2026
        Platform ........ Python 3 + Tkinter (Windows / Linux / macOS)
