.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
|                            D E S C R I P T I O N                            |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

  KeyMine is a key generator and validator for Mine-imator, the free 3D movie
  maker based on Minecraft.

  Mine-imator checks keys that are 8 characters long and made of A-Z and 0-9.
  KeyMine builds keys that pass that check, and tests any key you give it
  against the same rules.

  Only the first four characters of a key are free. Each of the last four is
  the mirror partner of the character in the opposite position, taken from
  the 36-character set A-Z 0-9 read backwards. KeyMine works out those last
  four for you, from a random prefix or from one you type in.

  Key generation and validation do not modify Mine-imator. A separate, explicit
  command-line option can remove Data\key.midata from a selected installation
  directory.

