        [x] No third-party packages required

.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
|                             K E Y   F O R M A T                             |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

  Key layout (8 characters, A-Z and 0-9, not case sensitive):

        P1 P2 P3 P4 M4 M3 M2 M1          Pn = free prefix character
                                         Mn = mirror partner of Pn

  Mirror table - characters stacked on top of each other are partners:

        ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789
        9876543210ZYXWVUTSRQPONMLKJIHGFEDCBA

  Key positions pair up 1-8, 2-7, 3-6 and 4-5.

        Example:
        Prefix ........... DOHM
        Suffix ........... X2V6      (reverse the prefix, mirror each
                                      character:  M>X  H>2  O>V  D>6)
        Generated Key .... DOHMX2V6

  36^4 = 1,679,616 valid keys exist. Mine-imator only checks the pattern;
  there is no hidden secret, signature or server lookup behind it.

.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
|                                  U S A G E                                  |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

  Requires Python 3 with Tkinter (included with most standard Python
  installs). No pip install, no third-party packages.

  Run  python keygen.py  (or  py keygen.py  on Windows) to open the GUI.

  CUSTOM KEY
  ----------
  Type any 4-character prefix using A-Z and 0-9 (lowercase is converted
  to uppercase) and press GENERATE CUSTOM to build the completed key.

  RANDOM
  ------
  Press RANDOM to generate a fresh valid key.

  COPY
  ----
  Press the COPY button or Ctrl+C to copy the current key to the clipboard.

  VALIDATOR
  ---------
  Enter an 8-character key and press CHECK KEY.

        VALID      = key passes the Mine-imator key check
        NOT VALID  = key fails the Mine-imator key check

  MAPPING
  -------
  Shows the character-pair table used by the generator.

  NFO
  ---
  Press Ctrl+Shift+N to open this release NFO inside KeyMine.

  MUSIC
  -----
  The Windows GUI loops "Minefield Melody" at startup. Press Ctrl+Shift+P to
  toggle playback. Ctrl+Shift+M does the same, but some other apps grab that
  combination as a global hotkey. Closing KeyMine stops the track.

  KEYBOARD
  --------
  Ctrl+Shift+P   toggle music on/off
  Ctrl+Shift+M   same as Ctrl+Shift+P (may be grabbed by other apps)
  Ctrl+Shift+N   open the NFO viewer
  Ctrl+C         copy the current key

.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
|                           C O M M A N D   L I N E                           |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

        python keygen.py                      open the GUI (no arguments)
        python keygen.py --prefix DOHM        build a key from a prefix
        python keygen.py --validate DOHMX2V6  check a key
        python keygen.py --count 10           print 10 random keys
        python keygen.py --show-mapping       print the mirror table
        python keygen.py --delete-keyfile DIR   delete DIR\Data\key.midata

